    "A set this emulator's version doesn't know by that name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un set que cette version de l’émulateur ne connaît pas sous ce nom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zip of your saves, save states, collections and gamelists. The newest %lld are kept. Another drive or a synced folder keeps them safest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un zip de vos sauvegardes, états de sauvegarde, collections et gamelists. Les %lld plus récents sont gardés. Un autre disque ou un dossier synchronisé les protège le mieux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
