    "Folder added. Ready to scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier ajouté. Prêt pour l’analyse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folders Attic doesn't use": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossiers qu’Attic n’utilise pas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For MAME, NAOMI, Atomiswave, Model 2 and 3, ST-V and the other boards MAME runs. About 20 MB, from MAME's latest release.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour MAME, NAOMI, Atomiswave, Model 2 et 3, ST-V et les autres cartes que lance MAME. Environ 20 Mo, depuis la dernière version de MAME."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For Neo Geo, CPS-1, CPS-2, CPS-3 and FinalBurn Neo's other boards. About 14 MB, from FinalBurn Neo's repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour Neo Geo, CPS-1, CPS-2, CPS-3 et les autres cartes de FinalBurn Neo. Environ 14 Mo, depuis le dépôt de FinalBurn Neo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For anything still missing, see Game Info & Art.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour ce qui manque encore, voir Infos et illustrations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For multi-disc games, list the discs in an .m3u playlist (one file name per line) and keep only the .m3u visible, so the emulator can swap discs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour les jeux sur plusieurs disques, listez les disques dans une playlist .m3u (un nom de fichier par ligne) et ne laissez visible que le .m3u, pour que l’émulateur puisse changer de disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Format": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouvé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found MD5 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MD5 trouvé %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found as %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouvé sous %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found by the search": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouvés par la recherche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free play is on by default (Settings › General › Arcade), so Start begins a game without coins. Games first show the Neo Geo boot screen for about 10 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu libre est activé par défaut (Réglages › Général › Arcade) : Start lance une partie sans pièces. Les jeux affichent d’abord l’écran de démarrage Neo Geo pendant une dizaine de secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From another version (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D’une autre version (%lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full-screen couch mode (⌘⇧B, or Menu/Start on a controller)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mode canapé en plein écran (⌘⇧B, ou Menu/Start sur la manette)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GD-ROM": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GD-ROM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GD-ROM games are MAME romsets: keep each game's zip, and beside it the folder of the same name that holds its .chd. They boot from the NAOMI BIOS (naomi.zip), or NAOMI 2's (naomi2.zip) for NAOMI 2 games, in a dc folder inside the BIOS folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux GD-ROM sont des romsets MAME : gardez le zip de chaque jeu et, à côté, le dossier du même nom qui contient son .chd. Ils démarrent avec le BIOS NAOMI (naomi.zip), ou celui du NAOMI 2 (naomi2.zip) pour les jeux NAOMI 2, dans un dossier dc du dossier BIOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game & Watch games are .mgw files, converted from MAME's artwork and romsets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux Game & Watch sont des fichiers .mgw, convertis depuis les illustrations et romsets de MAME."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game Info & Art": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Infos et illustrations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game names, descriptions and artwork already in a gamelist.xml (from ES-DE, Batocera or RetroBat) and in a Media folder (ES-DE's downloaded_media) or a system's images and videos folders are picked up automatically. Arcade games get their real titles from FinalBurn Neo's game list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les noms, descriptions et illustrations déjà présents dans un gamelist.xml (d’ES-DE, Batocera ou RetroBat) et dans un dossier Media (downloaded_media d’ES-DE) ou les dossiers images et videos d’un système sont repris automatiquement. Les jeux d’arcade reçoivent leur vrai titre depuis la liste de jeux de FinalBurn Neo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gameplay": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games Added": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeux ajoutés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games Missing Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeux sans infos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games Played": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeux joués"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games are .hex files. A .arduboy download is a zip: take the .hex out of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux sont des fichiers .hex. Un téléchargement .arduboy est un zip : sortez-en le .hex."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games are .wasm files, from wasm4.org.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux sont des fichiers .wasm, de wasm4.org."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games are dumped game folders (with eboot.bin inside), renamed like Game.ps4. Installed .pkg files aren't supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux sont des dossiers de jeu extraits (avec eboot.bin dedans), renommés comme Jeu.ps4. Les fichiers .pkg ne sont pas pris en charge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games are matched by file name. Covers come from each game's thumbnail (the box), screenshots from its image; covers are saved as HEIC when that's smaller.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux sont associés par nom de fichier. Les jaquettes viennent de la vignette de chaque jeu (la boîte), les captures d’écran de son image ; les jaquettes sont enregistrées en HEIC quand c’est plus léger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games can be .iso files or game folders named like Game.ps3 (containing PS3_GAME).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux peuvent être des fichiers .iso ou des dossiers nommés comme Jeu.ps3 (contenant PS3_GAME)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games must be xiso-format .iso dumps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux doivent être des dumps .iso au format xiso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games played vertically can be rotated in RetroArch's core options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux qui se jouent à la verticale peuvent être pivotés dans les options du cœur de RetroArch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games show in red and black on a flat screen. Attic turns off the core's VR mode, which needs a kind of OpenGL macOS doesn't offer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux s’affichent en rouge et noir sur un écran plat. Attic désactive le mode VR du cœur, qui demande une forme d’OpenGL que macOS ne propose pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games the search finds are listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux trouvés par la recherche s’affichent ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
