            "value": "Lancez les parties sans insérer de pièces. S’applique aux jeux Neo Geo lancés avec FinalBurn Neo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick as D-pad": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick comme croix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SuFami Turbo cartridges are .st files. Snes9x plays them through the SuFami Turbo BIOS (STBIOS.bin), in the BIOS folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les cartouches SuFami Turbo sont des fichiers .st. Snes9x les lance via le BIOS SuFami Turbo (STBIOS.bin), dans le dossier BIOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Super Mario, Mario Bros": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Super Mario, Mario Bros"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap A/B and X/Y": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inverser A/B et X/Y"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch systems with LB / RB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changez de système avec LB / RB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langue du système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages du système…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System, then Release Date": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système, puis date de sortie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Systems": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Systèmes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect when Attic restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prend effet au prochain démarrage d’Attic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tennis, Golf, Kart": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tennis, Golf, Kart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn't a collection Attic can read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une collection qu’Attic sait lire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ core isn't installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cœur %@ n’est pas installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DAT couldn't be downloaded. Check the connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le DAT n’a pas pu être téléchargé. Vérifiez la connexion et réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Emulation folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier Emulation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Jaguar's number pad isn't on modern controllers; games that need it map its keys to spare buttons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le pavé numérique de la Jaguar n’existe pas sur les manettes modernes ; les jeux qui en ont besoin associent ses touches à des boutons libres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Virtual Boy's second D-pad is on the right stick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La deuxième croix directionnelle du Virtual Boy est sur le stick droit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assigned custom emulator profile no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le profil d’émulateur personnalisé attribué n’existe plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The collection is saved as a folder, with its list of games and its pictures. Import it with File › Import Collection….": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La collection est enregistrée comme un dossier, avec sa liste de jeux et ses images. Importez-la avec Fichier › Importer une collection…."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The core “%@” is no longer installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cœur « %@ » n’est plus installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is a folder named like Quake.quake with Quake's id1 folder inside (id1/pak0.pak, and pak1.pak for the full game).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu est un dossier nommé comme Quake.quake avec le dossier id1 de Quake dedans (id1/pak0.pak, et pak1.pak pour le jeu complet)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The games stay in your library. The collection's folder, with its pictures, goes to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux restent dans votre bibliothèque. Le dossier de la collection, avec ses images, va à la corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The known dump's checksum, which the file has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La somme de contrôle du dump connu, que le fichier a bien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The known dump's checksum: the file has a 512-byte header before it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La somme de contrôle du dump connu : le fichier a un en-tête de 512 octets avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The left stick option applies to RetroArch games; Select + Start also quits DuckStation. Games save normally on the way out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’option du stick gauche s’applique aux jeux RetroArch ; Select + Start quitte aussi DuckStation. Les jeux sauvegardent normalement en quittant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The size differs too: it's likely another file, a damaged copy, or a dump with something added. Dump it again, or look for the expected one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La taille diffère aussi : c’est sans doute un autre fichier, une copie abîmée, ou un dump avec quelque chose en plus. Refaites le dump, ou cherchez celui attendu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The touch screen follows the mouse; click to touch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’écran tactile suit la souris ; cliquez pour toucher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB doesn't support this system yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB ne prend pas encore en charge ce système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB isn't configured yet — add your API key in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB n’est pas encore configuré — ajoutez votre clé d’API dans les Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB matches by searching the ROM's title text rather than an exact filename/CRC match like ScreenScraper, so results can be a bit fuzzier — useful as a fallback while you wait on a ScreenScraper devID, or anytime ScreenScraper has no match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB recherche d’après le titre de la ROM plutôt qu’une correspondance exacte de nom de fichier/CRC comme ScreenScraper, les résultats peuvent donc être un peu moins précis — pratique en solution de repli en attendant un devID ScreenScraper, ou quand ScreenScraper ne trouve rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB only needs a self-serve API key — create a free account and generate one from your account page, no separate software-registration review needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB n’a besoin que d’une clé d’API en libre-service — créez un compte gratuit et générez-la depuis votre page de compte, sans validation préalable du logiciel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheGamesDB rejected the request (bad API key or quota exceeded): %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheGamesDB a refusé la requête (clé d’API incorrecte ou quota dépassé) : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their files and media go to the Trash, and they leave the library with their play history. Put Back in the Trash restores the files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leurs fichiers et médias vont dans la corbeille, et ils quittent la bibliothèque avec leur historique de jeu. Remettre à sa place dans la corbeille restaure les fichiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their media and info are replaced by the other front-end's, where it has some. The files replaced go to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leurs médias et infos sont remplacés par ceux de l’autre front-end, quand il en a. Les fichiers remplacés vont à la corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These games run in MAME's current core, so the romsets must come from the same MAME version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces jeux tournent dans le core MAME actuel : les romsets doivent venir de la même version de MAME."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This look needs RetroArch’s shader pack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce rendu nécessite le pack de shaders de RetroArch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
