    "Vita3K couldn't install %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vita3K n’a pas pu installer %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vita3K is installing %@. A game starts once it's in: close Vita3K to carry on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vita3K installe %@. Un jeu démarre une fois installé : fermez Vita3K pour continuer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vita3K uses its own controller setup. Configure it once in Vita3K (Controls) — Attic's controller settings don't apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vita3K utilise sa propre configuration de manette. Configurez-la une fois dans Vita3K (Controls) — les réglages de manette d’Attic ne s’appliquent pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Attic": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenue dans Attic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's left in Batocera's media folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restes des dossiers de médias de Batocera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the game sorts in the library, e.g. “Legend of Zelda, The”. Leave empty to sort by title.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position du jeu dans le tri de la bibliothèque, p. ex. « Legend of Zelda, The ». Laissez vide pour trier par titre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which System Are These For?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour quel système sont-ils ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widescreen (16:9)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écran large (16:9)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widescreen shows more of the scene instead of stretching it; some games show glitches at the edges.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’écran large affiche une plus grande partie de la scène au lieu de l’étirer ; certains jeux présentent des défauts sur les bords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wikipedia": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wikipédia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the retro look, systems left on Default get CRT scanlines (2D consoles and arcade) or an LCD grid (handhelds). Choose a different look per system with right-click › System Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec le rendu rétro, les systèmes laissés « Par défaut » ont des lignes de balayage CRT (consoles 2D et arcade) ou une grille LCD (consoles portables). Choisissez un autre rendu par système avec clic droit › Réglages du système…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Account (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre compte (facultatif)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Games": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos jeux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ROMs folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre dossier de ROMs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your games already had all of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos jeux avaient déjà tout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yours": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le vôtre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zipped games are unzipped to be played. The copies can go: a game unzips again when it next starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux en ZIP sont décompressés pour être joués. Ces copies peuvent partir : un jeu se décompresse à nouveau au prochain lancement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zips your saves, save states, collections and gamelists into your backup folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compresse vos sauvegardes, états de sauvegarde, collections et gamelists dans votre dossier de sauvegarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[b]": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[b]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "and %lld more": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "et %lld de plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "chdman couldn't convert %@. Its files haven't changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "chdman n’a pas pu convertir %@. Ses fichiers n’ont pas changé."
          }
        }
